<title>UK: DEUTSCHE AUSTRALIA SETS NZ$300 MLN THREE-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE AUSTRALIA SETS NZ$300 MLN THREE-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and TD Securities.  BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSTRALIA LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$300 MLN    COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    29.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.695   PAY DATE    29.AUG.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  1.375  </p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU/DE/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   1.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
